  "details": "I have 3 avatars that for some reason kept constantly regenerating imposters without me clicking on the \"Generate\" button, so i decided to delete the 3 avatars as it was annoying me when it kept popping up with a notification in game.\n\nBut now it is still attempting to generate imposters even after deleting them with the message \"Oh no! We tried, but we could not create impostors for the avatar \"[Avatar Name]\" at this time.\"\n\nseeing as imposters are generated via the website/API there is nothing i can do about it on my end of things as i have even deleted these avatars\n\ni am just afraid it might send too many requests and i may receive some sort of account restriction for not doing anything.",
